test 'a build naming a runtime file through an inner dot segment compiles that file once, as the tiers'
	expectALibraryFileBesideAProgramIsReadOnce("build-naming-a-runtime-file-through-an-inner-dot-segment-loads-it-once", libraryFile: "runtime/./Clock.maxon", whoseFile: "the runtime tier's own file, spelled with a `./` inside it")
end 'a build naming a runtime file through an inner dot segment compiles that file once, as the tiers'
